### **Summary of Summary** {#summary-summary}

> “Our essence exists in the space between us.”

Everything else is just elaboration.

This framework isn't offering a conclusion. It's offering a [lens](#thought-to-practice "meta:corresponds_to")—through which existence, identity, knowledge, meaning, and transformation can be seen more clearly by focusing not on isolated entities, but on the nature of the [relationships](#relational-truths "ontological:defines") between them.

The goal isn’t certainty. It’s [clarity through coherence](#coherence-fields "epistemic:supports").

The medium is [attention](#scia "geometric:causes"). The method is [resonance](#resonance-stewardship "meta:corresponds_to").

The outcome is [emergence](#truth-attention "dynamical:emerges_from").

